#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Editor Chooser"
msgstr "Wuběranje editora"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid ""
"Please choose the default text editing component that you wish to use in "
"this application. If you choose <B>System Default</B>, the application will "
"honor your changes in the Control Center. All other choices will override "
"that setting."
msgstr ""
"Prošu wubjerće sej standardnu komponentu za editowanje tekstow, kiž chceće w "
"tutym programje wužiwać. Wubjereće-li <B>Systemowy standard</B>, změje so "
"program po wašich nastajenjach w Control Center. Wšitke druhe změni tute "
"nastajenje."

